12. Digital Twin and Validation Programme

12.1 Digital twin fidelity

The digital twin is used for predictive maintenance, fault simulation, and energy optimisation. It is not part of the safety chain. Fidelity levels are:

· L0: point-mass dynamics m\ddot{x} = F_{em} - mg - c\dot{x};
· L1: electromechanical motor model with inverter dynamics;
· L2: electromagnetic finite-element analysis and thermal network;
· L3: full-system co-simulation including aerodynamics, structure, and control.

