Q.4 Segment Switching and Handover Sequence

```
Shaft (side view, vertical direction)

  [Module N+2]   (idle)
  [Module N+1]   (pre-excited, 50% current)
  =====================================   <-- Capsule enters overlap zone
  [Module N]     (active, full current)  <-- Outgoing module
  [Module N-1]   (active)
  [Module N-2]   (recently deactivated)
  [Module N-3]   (idle)

Overlap zone: 0.4 m, time = 40 ms at 10 m/s

Outgoing force: F_out = F_ref * (1 - s/L_overlap)
Incoming force: F_in  = F_ref * (s/L_overlap)

Total force remains constant: F_out + F_in = F_ref
```

